OL,3,GNEWSAWork to reduce flood risk in two
OL,4,Avillages to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to reduce the risk of flooding in
OL,7,Ftwo villages in Leicestershire is set
OL,8,Fto begin.
OL,10,FLeicestershire County Council said it
OL,11,Fwould start work to carry out drainage
OL,12,Fimprovements in Enderby Road,
OL,13,FWhetstone, on 5 October and in Mill
OL,14,FHill, Enderby, from 26 October.
OL,16,FThe Reform UK-run authority said work
OL,17,Fin Enderby Road was expected to take
OL,18,Fplace until 27 November, with works in
OL,19,FMill Hill set to conclude on 21
OL,20,FDecember.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
